# Virtualization

Sortable list of 5000 items, rendered through [`virtua`](https://github.com/inokawa/virtua) — only the rows visible in the viewport (plus a small buffer) live in the DOM.

`<DndDraggable>` is rendered inside `<VList>`'s `children` snippet, so each item registers a slot the moment virtua mounts it. `<DndDroppable>` wraps `<VList>` so the strategy still owns the list as a single drop container.

